      "widgets_values": [
        "To set the size of output image :\n\n1- connect \"VAE Encode\" node output (LATENT) to \"Ksampler input (latent_image). It will set the image output size same as input size.\n🛑note : FluxKontextImageScale node below should be bypassed. (Active FluxKontextImageScale when your input image size is big, it will optimize the image size for you)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2- connect \"EmptySD3LatentImage\" output (LATENT) to \"Ksampler input (latent_image). It will put the image output size to the value you set in the EmptySD3LatentImage node (Height and width)."
